                                                                                
 Usage: opentide explain [OPTIONS] [code]                                       
                                                                                
 Explain a diagnostic code and how to fix it                                    
                                                                                
 Prints what the code means, an example, and how to fix it.                     
                                                                                
╭─ Arguments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│   code      <str>  A diagnostic code, such as vocab_unknown. Omit it to list │
│                    every code.                                               │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --help          Show this message and exit.                                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide explain vocab_unknown
   $ opentide explain
